    <briefdescription>
<para>Fixture for diff/merge benchmarks. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Owns an InMemoryDocumentStore and InMemoryDocumentDiffMerge engine. <ref refid="classthemis_1_1bench_1_1document_1_1_document_diff_merge_fixture_1abb52ea6adf27ec1f40a41dd7ddaee14d" kindref="member">SetUp()</ref> pre-populates all document variants required by DDM-BM-01..08 so that benchmark bodies contain only the measured diff()/merge() call.</para>
<para>Seed: kDocCanonicalSeed = 42 (used for deterministic field naming; actual document content is fixed, not randomly generated at runtime).</para>
<para>Warmup: 50 diff + 50 merge calls prime branch predictor before the measurement window opens. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
